Antigravity Tech Landing Page
A modern and responsive tech landing page built using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. This project showcases a clean UI design with structured sections and smooth navigation.

🌟 Features
Responsive navigation bar
Hero banner with modern UI
About section with image layout
Feature cards (Performance, Security, Scalability)
Contact form UI
Clean and structured design

🛠️ Tech Stack
HTML5
CSS3
JavaScript

